'@@author Rixte
@startuml
!include ../shortfall/readable.iuml
title Executing an accepted change
actor User
participant MishMash
participant "Plan-changing command" as Command
participant ActiveMealPlan as Active
note over MishMash, Command : Starts after a question was returned.
MishMash -> User : question (y/n)
User --> MishMash : y or yes
MishMash -> MishMash : trim and compare ignoring case
MishMash -> Command : execute(recipeBook)
ref over Command, Active : Command-specific execution
Command --> MishMash : feedback or recoverable error
MishMash --> User : result and next prompt
note over Command, Active
  Reset clears plan state.
  Successful generation replaces the plan.
  Failed generation preserves the old state.
  Dietary repair failure clears both lists.
end note
@enduml
'@@author
